summary:
  A stream taken for dead leaves its buffer's writer running.

history:
  On the bench, a stall of forty seconds: the old writer gave up on its own
  stalled connection while the start that followed was still waiting for
  the station, the engine found nobody playing and took the arm down, and
  the station came back with no buffer. A pause two minutes later was a
  stop, and Play joined the broadcast twenty seconds further on.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StandWatch.qml

find:
          engine.disarm();

replace:
          engine.shifted;

expect:
  Killed by tst_standwatch::test_a_position_that_stands_hands_the_stream_over_once.
  Line-neutral.
